Subject: Cantor EVO-X2 Plan-Only Build Job P0 Exploded Meaning

@ [exploded_uuid] b7071f87-4034-45ad-ac9e-b353aba2b9e0
@ [canonical_uuid] 3482e2ce-817c-4788-b185-35adaad414f7

& [SemanticAtoms]
  + [request] is a content-bound description of a future current-source build
  + [plan] is deterministic inert data describing prerequisites operations and evidence
  + [operation] is a typed intended step and not a command authorization occurrence or receipt
  + [authority_grants] empty means no component may act from this plan
  + [authority_denials] preserves the exact forbidden capability surface
  + [unresolved] preserves facts the pure compiler cannot observe or truthfully settle
  + [verification] means request and plan correspondence only

& [IdentityFlow]
  + published source -> strict request -> request digest -> deterministic plan UUID -> seven operations -> plan digest -> independent recompile -> byte equality

& [HostFlow]
  + immutable package -> absent isolated root -> fresh compiler1 -> verifier1 -> fresh compiler2 -> verifier2 -> retrieved evidence -> local dual-host replay

& [AuthorityFlow]
  + source publication authorizes formation
  + formation publication authorizes local implementation
  + implementation publication authorizes one bounded remote plan-only run
  + no transition authorizes the physical source build

& [RefusalMeaning]
  + any shape identity digest bound path dependency authority determinism package or protected-state mismatch terminates without promoted output

& [NonEquivalence]
  + planned is not executed compiled is not built verified is not authorized and measured plan latency is not build speed or agent productivity
